### 2. Evidence & Documentation (Discovery)
It is crucial to know what to gather before the preliminary hearing and what can wait for the formal "discovery" phase.
*   **"What specific types of evidence should I start collecting immediately?"** (e.g., employment contracts, severance agreements, emails, text messages, bank statements, or communication with your ex-spouse).
